  "title": "Book Your Next Getaway: New Bank of America Travel Center Makes it Easier to Plan and Book Memorable Travel Experiences",
  "summary": "Bank of America today announced the launch of an enhanced Travel Center, making it easier for clients to plan, book and manage travel. The newly redesigned platform powered by Rocket Travel by Agoda – the strategic partnerships arm of digital travel platform Agoda, a Booking Holdings company – features a wider selection of travel inventory, improved search and filtering capabilities and flexible payment options, including the ability to combine credit card rewards with a credit or debit card payment when booking travel.",
